===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*standaną}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ang}} {{m|ine-pro|*steh₂-}}. Cognate with Old Frisian [[standa]], Old High German [[stantan]], Old Saxon [[standan#Old Saxon|standan]], Old Norse [[standa]], Gothic [[𐍃𐍄𐌰𐌽𐌳𐌰𐌽]]. The Germanic source is cognate with Greek {{l|grc|ἵστημι}}, Latin [[stare]], Old Irish [[tairissiur]], Old Slavic ''stojati'' (Russian [[стоять]]).

